---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import rose from "../content/img/rose.png";
import Skills from '../components/Skills.astro'
---

<section class="about">
  <div class="intro-text">
    <h2 class="intro-title">A Quick Intro!</h2>
    <p class="intro-subtitle">Get to know me and my skills :)</p>
  </div>
  <article class="about-me">
    <div class="about-photo">
      <Image class="about-media" src={rose} alt="Image of a rose for now" />

      <button class="float-button float-languages" popovertarget="languages-popup">Trilingual</button>
      <button class="float-button float-hobbies" popovertarget="hobbies-popup">Hobbies</button>
    </div>
    <p>I'm Rose Sananikone, a digital design and development student in the DEVINE program in Howest. I'm always eager and excited to explore more and push the limits of my skills to further develop them and combining them with my hobbies and other experiences.</p>
  </article>

    <Skills />


  <div id="languages-popup" class="popup" popover>
    <button class="popup-close" popovertarget="languages-popup" popovertargetaction="hide">Close</button>
    <h2>Trilingual</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>English</li>
      <li>French</li>
      <li>German</li>
    </ul>
    <p>I have to switch language depending on who I am talking to pretty often and have experienced many different cultures from european, to middle eastern to asian cultures which all shape how I design for different people or ideas. Sharing experiences and exchanging different perspectives with people all over the world is my favourtie. </p>
  </div>

    <div id="hobbies-popup" class="popup" popover>
    <button class="popup-close" popovertarget="hobbies-popup" popovertargetaction="hide">Close</button>
    <h2>Hobbies</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Playing flute</li>
      <li>Playing videogames/board games</li>
      <li>Hosting friends</li>
      <li>Cooking</li>
    </ul>
    <p>I usually try to combine my hobbies with my skills such as creating experiences people enjoy by inviting friends and curating the right food and activities to do!</p>
  </div>


   <!-- Option 2: Personally -->
  <!-- icons with my interests -->
  <!-- Playing flute -->
  <!-- Video games -->
  <!-- Interest in motion graphics and creative technology -->
  <!-- Love going out with friends and exploring new places -->

</section>

<style>

  .intro-text {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
 }

  h2 {
  margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .intro-subtitle {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

 .about-me {
  display: grid;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 2rem;
 }

  /* the buttons are positioned relative to this wrapper */
  .about-photo {
    position: relative;
    width: min(100%, 40rem);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

 .about-media {
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  object-fit: cover;
 }

  /* no border, just a shadow so they look like they float above the photo */
  .float-button {
    position: absolute;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    box-shadow: 0 0.75rem 2rem rgb(27 23 22 / 0.18);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.3s ease, scale 0.3s ease;
  }

  .float-button:hover,
  .float-button:focus-visible {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    scale: 1.05;
  }

    .float-hobbies {
    top: 70%;
    left: 1rem;
  }

  .float-languages {
    bottom: 12%;
    right: 1rem;
  }

  /* slow floating */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .float-button {
      animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .float-languages {
      animation-delay: -2s;
    }
  }

  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { translate: 0 0; }
    50% { translate: 0 -0.5rem; }
  }


  /* card that slides up from below when it opens */
  .popup {
    width: min(90vw, 60rem);
    max-height: 85dvh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    color: var(--color-text);
    box-shadow: 0 1.5rem 4rem rgb(27 23 22 / 0.25);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(3rem);
    transition:
      opacity 0.4s ease,
      transform 0.4s ease,
      overlay 0.4s allow-discrete,
      display 0.4s allow-discrete;
  }

  .popup:popover-open {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  /* where the card starts from when it opens */
  @starting-style {
    .popup:popover-open {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(3rem);
    }
  }

  .popup::backdrop {
    background-color: rgb(27 23 22 / 0);
    transition:
      background-color 0.4s ease,
      overlay 0.4s allow-discrete,
      display 0.4s allow-discrete;
  }

  .popup:popover-open::backdrop {
    background-color: rgb(27 23 22 / 0.5);
  }

  @starting-style {
    .popup:popover-open::backdrop {
      background-color: rgb(27 23 22 / 0);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .popup,
    .popup:popover-open {
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  .popup-close {
    float: right;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .popup-close:hover,
  .popup-close:focus-visible {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>
